    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5020e6c9681e0f325dd316e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "闭嘴！你丫肯定耍了什么心眼儿！！\r\n那手烂牌都敢ALL IN，用屁眼想都不可能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90f1bd5f2be8cc58b79cc96d82b69f73ee465041941e09ebc34071cbe246d39f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
