    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06f0e6ad59a5807ce3f22b10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你这混蛋……差不多就承认了吧。\r\n想被我们打到这辈子再也没法跑步吗？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52072c0cf7bc68c8f6fd809b7053b2164fd14ddce937d77e877f400e3b868c9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d529e4ce535956e8f5e9d46",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "眼瞧这帮混混的威胁愈发偏激，\r\n我不假思索地站到了中山庆典的身前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "252fcddc509234603b6d17032296b2f77b23dd8f905bea66be66a37b3cee9942",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ac097c296808be19186fea8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果她又打算主动把自己送入危险境地的话，\r\n我必须要挺身出来保护她才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "444d06c57b97ce376cd7a7ba95f35e553da30bd49cdd83982ff3b85256b9f5fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167db62751afd023fbdb2748",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
