      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90037846adbd677c2d61f112",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂，快让开。\r\n这是我和这些家伙的恩怨，你别掺进来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "358759d2d9d6d6694980200fa5351a5ccd00c03aece8834e9521c11853db4b90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2ebd20318459d2c421a05c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样就行吗？那来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db8e640b1370348460f81f2183dce277748483813c5050b6c1529f757fd2cc76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
