    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbfef2cc0c65aa403ea72fee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "搞什么……嘴还挺硬啊。\r\n你想一辈子躺在病床上下达训练指示吗？！啊？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1a74f3a6a396c988043b81a01205d71d4c9e988504995ff3f4e6749c836aa70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbcd30c1131da3aecaa57a96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看上去像是小头目的人将指关节捏得咔咔作响。\r\n说实话……要真打起来的话——我大概没什么胜算。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a881e66497a350f27788e25c8bd0c01f54776d9b39876ef7421c88393e6eaad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51ffaa3012fb8f377cc31575",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "快点吧，我都快站感冒了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc63e74084b7b209801ef252f903b9bc452f1c18141d6113600eb1d95237b1e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
