    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b1c48ce1c1adba275944d97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我也说过，不管招来什么噩运都要支持中山、保护她的未来。\r\n身为训练员，此时绝不能退让……绝不能……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d5fa48312c7ba62848b7338a8dd5533a202eb1c0a046ec4d286b12455bf4a16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b443b1be4ab2244968f14ad8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我站到中山庆典身前，张开双臂，\r\n一步步慢慢逼近对方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbdc9b695faccacd09fdcd23bc8fa526c809fa10923d3510dc8c19fbd4e8f514",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
