    {
      "uid": "zhcn:983f87d38eea802cd0219504",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我依然颤抖不已，顺着中山所指的方向，\r\n看向橱窗中所映出的自己的表情——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cad45e7677a7fe3297257ccf95fc780bdfbe2dd1de573b58ac4a2e262e6d157",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:140b0e56e4ae85516b8332d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当我看见我那副模样、那副表情时，心中只剩下愕然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc1310d0554c1ca687ed76cf9c088a623092cc5623a7a22741e09bcdd2f9964e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
