    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02636ec50b544fa4628f75ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿……看来之后是能好好享受一下了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3a089b0cb13be4bb57c7d9b07594da87d61bab5962ea0e7b3a2f961eac3cee5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f49da586ef0fe4f5accad2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我晕头转向地回到家中。\r\n踏入家门的那一刻，疲劳感猛然袭来，令我直接瘫倒在床上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61e3863952bdd689d63a39caacc4d69696dc7bc26822b4900b5ed444349c1b06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
