      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0e8ab7812290eb18167ed59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着至今仍在微微颤抖的手臂，回忆起方才自己的模样，\r\n我脑中自然而然地响起中山庆典的话语——",
      "source_fingerprint": "71e324c7022dbbdbb05d72c495258e58612bf504414131002968f863a10fcb17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
