      "uid": "zhcn:2b14c9d4d6b4388feac74798",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一边是意味深长地微笑着的中山庆典，一边则是镜中的自己。\r\n两者在我脑中盘旋、交融——在思维的漩涡之中，我渐渐睡去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69f40dd0a3f39ea0e38bfb03f02b83a91c0629e2b09da2effd9a1644c7f0d4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
